    refresh button has an accessibilityLabel; Dynamic Type via tokens; Reduce Motion respected by the
    shared TSSkeleton shimmer.
  Telemetry → LiveSignalsModel.start() emits viewOpened(surface:"LiveSignalsWidget") → bridges shared
